@startuml

actor Alice
actor Bob
actor Charlie
participant Notary as "Non-Validating Notary"

== 🔄 Request Confidential Identity ==
Bob -> Alice : RequestKeyFlow
note right of Alice
Generates new key for Bob’s external ID  
Sends signed challenge-response
end note
Alice --> Bob : SignedKeyForBob

note right of Bob
Registers PublicKey → Alice in IdentityService  
Mapping stored locally only  
Third parties cannot resolve it
end note

== ❌ Optional Deniability ==
alt Alice declines mapping
note right of Alice
Does NOT store key mapping in IdentityService  
Can deny ownership later  
Prevents downstream verification
end note
else Alice accepts
Alice -> IdentityService : registerKey(PublicKey, CordaX500Name)
end alt

== 💼 Optional Account Integration ==
Bob -> KeyManagementService : freshKey(UUID)
note right of Bob
Maps PublicKey → externalId (UUID)  
Stored in PublicKeyHashToExternalId
end note

== 🔐 Transaction Assembly ==
Alice -> Notary : Submit input state hashes
note right of Notary
Non-validating: receives only state hashes  
Cannot resolve identities
end note
Notary --> Alice : OK

== 🔄 SyncKeyMappingsFlow ==
Alice -> Bob : SyncKeyMappingsFlow
note right of Bob
Receives mapping: PublicKey → CordaX500Name  
Used to validate incoming states
end note

== ⚠️ Threat: Withholding Mappings ==
alt Alice withholds mapping
note right of Bob
Cannot validate inputs  
Transaction rejected or unverifiable
end note
else Alice provides mapping
note right of Bob
Fully validates key ownership  
Accepts transaction
end note
end alt

== 👁️ Third-Party Forwarding ==
Bob -> Charlie : Passes state using Alice’s key
note right of Charlie
Sees only PublicKey (AnonymousParty)  
Cannot resolve identity without mapping  
Requires SyncKeyMappingsFlow or prior knowledge
end note

@enduml
